Z||000010||Master_Sushi||08-16-2001||12:03 PM||||I own 2 fieros at the moment. My 88 coupe is my daily driver by far. But im also restoring a Black 4-Speed 84SE. I cant wait to get it finished  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">. I have never driven a stick shift fiero, and it will be fun to try out what ive been working so hard on for months. I will really only be able to keep one fiero though  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">. So expect to see it for sale in a few months. I also might have to sell my 88 coupe, because I will most likely need a bigger car <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">.<P>------------------<BR>88 Fiero Coupe...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mesopotamis_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
